# Track 6.2 Slice 2 — Guardian Classifier Taxonomy Projection — COMPLETE

Date: 2026-09-10
Branch: `build/initial-product`

## Scope

This checkpoint closes the second bounded Slice of approved Track 6 item 2 — universal classifiers.

The Slice adds the approved Guardian anomaly-family taxonomy as a read-only projection of the existing Track 4 universal bottleneck analyzer result. It introduces no new causal heuristic and no action authority.

## Permanent implementation

Plan:

`docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-10-track6-guardian-classifier-taxonomy.md`

Core:

`src/FFPerformanceEngine.Core/Services/GenericGuardianBottleneckClassifier.cs`

Tests:

`tests/FFPerformanceEngine.Core.SelfTest/GenericGuardianClassifierTaxonomySelfTests.cs`

## Contract

Added `GuardianAnomalyKind`:

- `Unknown`
- `CpuContention`
- `GpuSaturation`
- `MemoryPressure`
- `VramPressure`
- `FrameTimeInstability`
- `BackgroundLoad`
- `ThermalThrottling`
- `NetworkInstability`
- `RendererEngineStall`
- `SchedulerImbalance`
- `InputFrameLatencySpike`

Added computed read-only `GenericGuardianBottleneckClassification.Family`.

The property projects only `BottleneckAnalysisResult.Primary` and never inspects raw telemetry.

Evidence-backed mappings:

- `BottleneckKind.Cpu` → `CpuContention`
- `Gpu` → `GpuSaturation`
- `Memory` → `MemoryPressure`
- `Vram` → `VramPressure`
- `FramePacing` → `FrameTimeInstability`
- `Thermal` → `ThermalThrottling`
- `Network` → `NetworkInstability`

All other analyzer kinds project to Guardian `Unknown`; the raw analyzer result remains intact.

## Capability-honest negative guarantees

The Slice explicitly proves that:

- high raw `FrameLatencyAverageMs` alone does not create `InputFrameLatencySpike`;
- high total system CPU alone does not create `BackgroundLoad` or `SchedulerImbalance`;
- missing render activity alone does not create `RendererEngineStall`;
- analyzer `Unknown`, `None`, `StorageIo` and `Power` are not relabeled into unrelated approved Guardian families;
- existing fail-closed non-Active Guardian gates remain Family `Unknown`;
- reading the Family projection does not rewrite source observation, analyzer result, candidates or signals.

`Unknown` means unavailable/unproven causal family, never “healthy”.

