## Authority preserved

- `Observed != Validated`.
- No new causal thresholds.
- No raw telemetry promotion into unsupported families.
- No recommendation/action/canary/validation/persistence authority.
- Existing specialized Guardian remains unchanged.
- Global Controlled Benchmark Lease and Guardian suspend/reconcile remain unchanged.

## Next boundary

Track 6 item 2 remains active until callers can distinguish which approved Guardian anomaly families are currently evidence-backed versus intentionally unavailable.

Next Slice: add a static/read-only classifier support/availability contract. The seven mapped families are currently evidence-backed by the typed analyzer path. `BackgroundLoad`, `RendererEngineStall`, `SchedulerImbalance` and `InputFrameLatencySpike` must remain unavailable pending dedicated causal evidence. The contract must not interpret unavailable as healthy and must introduce no new telemetry heuristic.
